   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Gather data over the past 10 years for the level of the S&amp;P 500. How many of those years did the S&amp;P 500 have a return of at least 10%? If you had invested in $1,000 in an S&amp;P 500 index fund 10 years ago, would you have doubled your money yet? Is your answer consistent with Jim Cramer’s message? ",
